{"text": "[deadpan] Costco's chicken is a terrible business.\nFour ninety-nine. Same price since 2009.\nTheir own CFO once said they'd eat up to forty million a year in margin... just to keep it there.\nThen they built a four-hundred-fifty-million-dollar poultry complex in Nebraska.\n[deadpan] For the chicken.\nAnd where do they put it? The very back of the warehouse.\nEvery cheap-dinner run... is a walk past everything else.\nThe hot dog combo? Still a dollar fifty. Since 1985.\n[rewind] Wait. Rewind. The chicken was never the product.\nMembership fees: five point nine billion dollars last fiscal year.\nThat's roughly sixty-four percent of Costco's entire profit.\nForty million? [deadpan] That's a rounding error.\nNinety-two percent of US and Canadian members renew.\nThe chicken is proof the card's worth it.\nSources in the pinned comment. Because on paper...", "model": "eleven_v3", "voice": "DODLEQrClDo8wCz460ld", "alignment": {"characters": ["[", "d", "e", "a", "d", "p", "a", "n", "]", " ", "C", "o", "s", "t", "c", "o", "'", "s", " ", "c", "h", "i", "c", "k", "e", "n", " ", "i", "s", " ", "a", " ", "t", "e", "r", "r", "i", "b", "l", "e", " ", "b", "u", "s", "i", "n", "e", "s", "s", ".", "\n", "F", "o", "u", "r", " ", "n", "i", "n", "e", "t", "y", "-", "n", "i", "n", "e", ".", " ", "S", "a", "m", "e", " ", "p", "r", "i", "c", "e", " ", "s", "i", "n", "c", "e", " ", "2", "0", "0", "9", ".", "\n", "T", "h", "e", "i", "r", " ", "o", "w", "n", " ", "C", "F", "O", " ", "o", "n", "c", "e", " ", "s", "a", "i", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", "y", "'", "d", " ", "e", "a", "t", " ", "u", "p", " ", "t", "o", " ", "f", "o", "r", "t", "y", " ", "m", "i", "l", "l", "i", "o", "n", " ", "a", " ", "y", "e", "a", "r", " ", "i", "n", " ", "m", "a", "r", "g", "i", "n", ".", ".", ".", " ", "j", "u", "s", "t", " ", "t", "o", " ", "k", "e", "e", "p", " ", "i", "t", " ", "t", "h", "e", "r", "e", ".", "\n", "T", "h", "e", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", "y", " ", "b", "u", "i", "l", "t", " ", "a", " "